{"parse": {"title": "NWE-03", "pageid": 69808, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-02\" title=\"NWE-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NWE-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-04\" title=\"NWE-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NWE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BF.A1.E4.BB.B0.E7.8E.A9.E7.AC.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"信仰玩笑\">信仰玩笑</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 信仰玩笑</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Salvation</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>贬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>损<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>侮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>辱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>噢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191803</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>治愈与帮助只是我们工作的一小部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康复中心收容着大量精神不稳定的病人，除却保护他们，我们同样需要保护自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>你们想把我的灵魂从脑袋里掏出来！把我的器官都偷走……再把那些……那些该死的诅咒塞进我的身体里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我不容许，我不容许！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挥动着手里的针管，躲在墙角，威慑着所有试图靠近的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们必须按求助铃！多萝西娅医生，柯布先生已经完全失控了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>不，等等，再等等！拜托，多萝西娅，发动你的脑子，一定是什么情景导致了他的应激……让我想想怎么让他平静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个身影唐突出现在了我的背后，拍了拍我的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>让我试试，孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么？可你自己也是一位病人！我们不能这样做……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>……你醒酒了吗？杰瑞·威尔逊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>托你的苦喉腥消毒液，当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我盯着他，犹豫了一阵，向其他职员点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>嘿，我的朋友柯布，你可把我的早餐给搅黄了，是什么让你这么激动？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>让我们聊聊好吗？我可以把我的面包分一片给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他蹑着脚步，接近那个歇斯底里的老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>别吃他们的早餐！别喝那些掺了毒的牛奶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>没问题！没问题，朋友！别这么犯紧张，酒精才是我的上帝，至于牛奶……噗，我可从不喝那玩意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>那太好，太好了！你是个正常人……你的头不会变成菱形，也不会变成那些恐怖的犄角怪了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柯布压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>听我说，他们偷偷把勺子换成了三角形的样子……这样他们就可以把几何埋在你的肚子里，直到他冲破你血肉模糊的肚脐！你就跟他们一样了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>你瞧……我刚好也有一个勺子，但它是……椭圆形的！这能让你好受一些吗？朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>我们揭穿了他们的诡计，接下来你要假装无事发生，回到房间里，那样可以骗过他们，他们会以为你是跟他们一伙的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰瑞·威尔逊揽住他的肩膀，把椭圆形的勺子塞进他的兜里，就像是他的一位表兄弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们谁都没注意到那只三角形的勺子是罪魁祸首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，我们很顺利地把柯布送回了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>棕发小姑娘，你该把你吓人的表情收着一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>大多时候，他们只是需要一张像他们祖母的脸，给他们唱几首摇篮曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>你的神秘术……叫什么来着，对，磁流疗法！那可不是百灵药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……不，我的神秘术已经得到了反复验证……它不可能出错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>一定是我做的不够好……是我、我……还没有完全掌握它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我本该让他平静下来，这是我的责任，我的义务……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手抓挠着头发，嘴里的话从一成不变的重复，渐渐变成喃喃低语，破碎的只言片语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我看到她引以为傲的唯一在动摇，看到了惶恐，这是临界点——我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>……她还好么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔，小梅斯梅尔……孩子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我抓住她颤抖的手，她终于抬起头看到了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她涨红的眼睛看着我，但我知道，她没有做错任何一件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>一块儿出去走走好吗？我想透透气。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_ye\"><img alt=\"hubian_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/600px-Cg-hubian_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/900px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-hubian_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉普拉斯康复中心附近的静养区算不上大方，但对于我们来说足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们坐下来，湖泊倒映出我们的衣服，和皎白色的月光混为一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有病人的哀嚎与呻吟，静谧久违地拜访了我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我从口袋里拿出了老朋友，衔在嘴上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>你知道吗？像我这样的人类，总是会需要信仰些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烟圈飘渺，很快消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>替我保守这个秘密，好吗？小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>在我认识的朋友里，有的人信仰酒精，有的人信仰梦境——而我信仰尼古丁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>当面临无可奈何的疾病与死亡时，这份信仰就会发挥真正的作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>我认识一名护士，她专门负责照顾那些被遗弃的、有缺陷的神秘学家的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔埋低身子，聚精会神看着我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>每当有一位孩子死去，她就会把一颗石子从头踢到尾，从医院外这头——到那一头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>等她踢完了，就会回到岗位上，就像什么也没发生过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>我从没见过这样稀奇古怪的信仰，但有一天，她却突然不踢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我停顿，熄灭了烟，不再说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>可为什么？这也算是她的信仰之一……不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>……让我卖个关子，我们得公平地交换秘密。<br />告诉我，你的信仰又是什么，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我不知道……第一防线学校规定不能有——你说的那些东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我只是在第一防线学校和拉普拉斯之间辗转，我的爸爸告诉我，未来我会成为拉普拉斯科算中心的重要一员，为家族争取荣誉，为和平事业做出贡献……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>而我的神秘术最适合干这些事情……我能让那些发疯的人平静下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>他们没征询过你的意见，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>可……来自梅斯梅尔家族的每个人，都必须善用自己的天赋。如果我们不这样做，就没有其他人能做到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>理性与规矩至关重要，我们必须要遵守他们。这样，事情才能正常地运转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>爸爸说，家族里的每个成员都发挥了自己的智慧，最后才得出了我们每个人的最优解……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>喔，真令人羡慕。相较起来，我可算是过惯了“最差解”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>这双手不仅端过盘子，还接生过一头50斤的小马，甚至直到现在我都还记得自己第一次晕血的滑稽场面——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>我从病床上醒过来，将来的同事们围在我身边，说“有只旱鸭子跳进海里了”，哈哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我从没有经历过……这样奇怪的生活，在第一防线学校，我们只做必须要做的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>孩子……会有机会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我拍拍她的肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>人工梦游机器正在进行记忆存储的实验，等康复中心忙活完了，我可以带你去我的梦里瞧瞧，我用软盘记录下了我的过去，那里有小马，还有我出洋相的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>况且，你不正是让别人入梦的小天才吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>自从来到拉普拉斯科算中心一段时间以后，我就再也没做过梦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不过……这也说明那些噩梦离我越来越远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但我知道，梦是压抑的情绪所在。如果情绪失去容身之地，那么它势必会在其他地方倾泻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>它肯定能让你睡个好觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>这可是连一个人类都深信不疑的神秘学小玩意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我……我们禁止佩戴这样的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我把她的手掌拎起来，将东西放入了她的手心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>把它放在你的床边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>总有一天你会用上它的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>喔～欢迎回来，女士们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>把这几粒药片吃下去，你的疗程就正式结束了，杰瑞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我在记录簿上记下他当前的身体状况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>别再试图通过自残来抗议了，替你擦屁股的是我们，而不是圣洛夫基金会的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>按照规定，你还会在这里疗养一段时间，杰瑞。希望接下来的日子好好相处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔从门外走了进来，这是最后一次对他施展磁流疗法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>请闭上眼睛，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他没有合上眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>冒昧地问一下，您……今天能把麻醉剂量调低一些吗？我想我已经可以做一个自由的梦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔不安地抬头看了看我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我耸耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>让他也做个好梦吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-303110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-303110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-303110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">铅玻璃：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>页数翻到了底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这就是日记的最后一段句子。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NWE-03"}}